sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Native client
  participant S as Fort service
  participant D as Durable ledger
  participant E as Isolated executor
  participant X as External capability
  C->>S: Command + request ID + immutable revision
  S->>D: Atomic request/run/configuration/outbox
  S-->>C: Durable receipt
  S->>E: Attempt ID + generation + digest + scope + deadline
  E-->>S: Sequenced started evidence
  S->>D: Idempotent evidence receipt
  opt External action requires approval
    E->>S: Exact action proposal + digest
    S-->>C: Approval request with destination and effects
    C->>S: Approve exact unexpired action
    S->>D: Persist decision and scoped authorization
    S-->>E: Bounded action grant
    E->>X: Authorized operation + idempotency key if supported
  end
  E-->>S: Bounded output + terminal evidence
  S->>D: Atomic result + event + evidence receipt
  S-->>C: Replayable state update
  Note over S,X: Lost connection after dispatch is unknown until reconciled.
  Note over S,X: Cancel request or process death does not undo an external effect.
